We have limited info: Q1 FY2007 Agilent. Revenue up 10% to $1.28B, adjusted EPS $0.39 up 34% YoY. Operating margin 14%, ROIC 23%. Bio-analytical strong growth 22% revenue, life science 23%, chemical analysis 21%. Electronic measurement modest 4% overall, 9% excluding weak handset test market. Guidance for Q2 revenue $1.3-1.34B (5-8% growth) and adjusted EPS $0.41-0.45 (14-25% increase YoY). Cash flow $93M, cash used $70M acquisitions, $254M share repurchase. Improved receivables and inventory.

