- **Cash generation & balance‑sheet strength** – Operating cash flow set a quarterly record at $1.35 bn (up $650 m YoY, $822 m sequentially). Debt‑to‑capital fell to 29.4%, the lowest since 1999, indicating ample financial flexibility.  
