Rationale:  

**What’s impressive**  
- **Revenue momentum:** +23 % QoQ (to $78 M) and +13.9 % YoY (to $303 M).  
- **Margin expansion:** Gross‑profit margin jumped from ~13.6 % to 24 % in the quarter and from 17.4 % to 23.3 % YoY.  
