**Management commentary** – Management highlighted a 3 % price hike, successful product redesigns, and gaining market share in core commercial segments (chillers, split systems). While the geothermal line softened due to lower natural‑gas prices, the company expects the chiller business to become a larger contributor over the next few years. Segment trends (lodging, office, healthcare) are broadly positive, offsetting weaker education and geothermal pockets.  

**Risks / caveats** –  
