**Cost structure** – SG&A rose modestly (≈9% YoY in the quarter, 3‑4% YoY for six months) but as a share of sales it is roughly flat (≈12%). The company is actively monitoring staffing and freight‑rate negotiations, but those cost pressures have already squeezed margins.

