Overall positive: strong earnings growth, margin expansion, cost discipline, cash generation, share repurchases, low leverage, ownership of facilities, good F&I and service contributions. Potential concerns: new vehicle margin pressure, inventory levels, macro auto market cyclicality, competition, reliance on F&I. But overall appears solid.

