**Tax considerations** – The effective tax rate fell dramatically to 22.2 % from 41.2 % YoY, but this is a one‑off benefit from retroactive employment‑tax credits. Management now expects a 36‑38 % rate for FY13, higher than the 32 % rate in FY12, which will compress net earnings going forward.  

