**Reimbursement & access** – The call highlights successful payer negotiations and “very good reimbursement and access” from both public and private plans. While encouraging, the sustainability of this advantage will depend on real‑world utilization, pricing pressure, and potential competition from off‑label antipsychotics or future entrants.

