**Growth & Top‑line Strength** – Q2 2016 revenue jumped 66.8% YoY to $756.5 million, marking the sixth straight quarter of >60% growth. Bed capacity has roughly doubled in the past year (≈17,800 beds) and the company plans to add >800 beds in 2016, indicating a robust expansion pipeline.  

