Rationale:  

**Revenue & Growth** – Q3 revenue of $65.7 million was essentially flat versus the prior quarter and the company now expects Q4 revenue of only $65‑70 million, i.e., no meaningful growth. The lack of any systems revenue from the memory segment or Korea, which historically contributed a sizable share, underscores a short‑term demand shortfall.

