**Revenue & earnings** – Q4 revenue of $69.4 million and full‑year 2016 revenue of $267 million were essentially in line with the company’s own updated guidance and with consensus estimates. The company is forecasting a 15 % jump to roughly $80 million in Q1, which would be a modest sequential increase and is already reflected in analysts’ models.  

