**Revenue & Growth** – Q2 FY‑2009 revenue fell 27 % year‑over‑year to $475 m and was essentially flat versus Q1. The decline is driven by a severe slowdown in the industrial, automotive and factory‑automation segments, which together still represent roughly half of ADI’s sales. While communications‑infrastructure revenue showed an 8‑10 % sequential rise, the overall top‑line picture remains a steep contraction versus the prior year.

