**Revenue & Growth** – ADP delivered $2.3 bn of revenue, up 14 % YoY and 12 % on an internal‑growth basis. All three core segments (Employer Services, Dealer Services, Brokerage) posted double‑digit top‑line growth, with Employer Services (the highest‑margin business) expanding 12 % and Brokerage up 9 %. This breadth of growth suggests the company’s strategic initiatives and recent acquisitions are paying off.

