**Revenue & earnings momentum** – ADP reported 7 % revenue growth (almost entirely organic) and 8 % pretax earnings growth for Q2 FY 2015. The modest impact of foreign‑currency translation (≈ ‑1 ppt) suggests the underlying business is still expanding at a healthy double‑digit rate. EPS also rose 8 % after a similar FX drag. These figures confirm that ADP’s core payroll and HCM platform continues to win new business (15 % worldwide new‑business bookings) and retain existing clients.

