- **Cloud & PLM push**: Launch of “Autodesk Cloud” and a forthcoming PLM offering position the firm ahead of a market that is still dominated by legacy, on‑premise solutions. Early mover advantage could capture a sizable share of a growing cloud‑based design market.  
