**Top‑line momentum** – Q3 2018 revenue jumped 26.7% YoY to $137.6 million, with organic growth of 3.7% and the balance coming from recent acquisitions. Management says same‑store revenue should stay in the 3‑5% range, indicating a sustainable growth floor even if deal flow slows.

