**Balance‑sheet strength** – Cash of $147.5 million versus $103.2 million of debt leaves a net cash position of roughly $44 million. The recent equity raise and an amended credit facility that lowers borrowing costs give the company ample liquidity to fund its acquisition pipeline without straining cash flow.

