Rationale:  

**Revenue & earnings momentum** – Q4 2018 revenue jumped 24.8% YoY to $139.8 M, and adjusted EPS rose 22.2% to $0.55. Adjusted EBITDA grew 17% to $12.3 M, showing the business can still scale.  

