2. **Strategic Shift to Regulated Business** – The company has **exited all merchant generation assets**, completing sales to affiliates of Dynegy and Rockland Capital. This reduces exposure to volatile wholesale markets and concentrates the balance sheet on **rate‑regulated utilities**, which typically deliver more predictable cash flows.

