1. **Earnings Beat & Guidance Upgrade**  
   - Q3 2016 EPS of **$1.52** versus $1.41 a year ago (≈ 8 % YoY increase).  
   - Management **raised full‑year 2016 EPS guidance** to **$2.65‑$2.75** (up from $2.45‑$2.65).  
