- **Risks & uncertainties** – The forward‑looking statements stress “limited visibility,” heavy reliance on government stimulus, ongoing panel oversupply, and a flat‑panel market that “may take some time to recover.” The macro‑cyclical nature of the core equipment markets remains a material downside risk.  

