Rationale:  

**Strengths highlighted in the call**  
- **Revenue & profitability:** 2007 sales hit a record $3 bn and operating margin was 19.6% (up 1 ppt on a comparable‑store basis). Those margins are high for the apparel sector and indicate pricing power and cost discipline.  
