- **Aggressive expansion:** Planning ~70 new stores in 2008 (plus continued Aerie rollout) will increase fixed costs at a time when sales momentum may be uneven. The payoff hinges on the success of the remodeling/pay‑back program and the ability to keep inventory turns high.  
