Rationale:  

**1. Earnings momentum & guidance** – Management says Q3 was “strong” and on‑track with 2011 guidance. Volume growth in Brazil (+4%), Chile (+>3%), Argentina (+7%) and overall Latin‑American generation supports higher earnings and cash flow. The company is confident it will meet full‑year targets.

