**Robust profitability metrics** – Core operating ROE rose to 15.7% from 12.7% a year earlier, indicating efficient capital use. The combined ratio of 90.4% (down 0.6 points YoY) and a 10% increase in underwriting profit underscore disciplined underwriting and pricing discipline.

